From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex local builder <codex@local.invalid>
Date: Thu, 27 Aug 2026 20:02:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] LOCAL: pair kernel release with stock system_dlkm

The stock system_dlkm image stores its modules under:

  6.12.69-android16-6-gb1493ec68d4a-abogki514973465-4k

Kleaf's unstamped local worktree produced 6.12.69-android16-6-4k, so Android
skipped the complete system_dlkm modules.load tree before attempting module
loading.  Pin only SCMVERSION to the archived stock release identity.  Symbol
CRC compatibility remains enforced separately.
---
 workspace_status.json | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 workspace_status.json

diff --git a/workspace_status.json b/workspace_status.json
new file mode 100644
index 000000000000..9dd7dc7b268c
--- /dev/null
+++ b/workspace_status.json
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+{
+    "SCMVERSION": "-gb1493ec68d4a-abogki514973465"
+}
-- 
2.55.0
